{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"To factor means to rewrite an expression as a product. Let's try dividing the expression $60-36w$ by each factor.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $6$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}60-36w\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=6\\left(\\dfrac{60-36w}{6}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=6\\left(\\dfrac{60}{6}-\\dfrac{36w}{6}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=6(10-6w)\n\\end{align}$\n\nYes, $60-36w$ is equivalent to $6(10-6w)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $4$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}60-36w\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=4\\left(\\dfrac{60-36w}{4}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=4\\left(\\dfrac{60}{4}-\\dfrac{36w}{4}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=4(15-9w)\n\\end{align}$\n\nNo, $60-36w$ is *not* equivalent to $4(15-8w)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $12$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}60-36w\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=12\\left(\\dfrac{60-36w}{12}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=12\\left(\\dfrac{60}{12}-\\dfrac{36w}{12}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=12(5-3w)\n\\end{align}$\n\nYes, $60-36w$ is equivalent to $12(5-3w)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $3$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}60-36w\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=3\\left(\\dfrac{60-36w}{3}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=3\\left(\\dfrac{60}{3}-\\dfrac{36w}{3}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=3(20-12w)\n\\end{align}$\n\nNo, $60-36w$ is *not* equivalent to $3(20+12w)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"The following expressions are equivalent to $60-36w$:\n\n- $6(10-6w)$\n- $12(5-3w)$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Factor $60-36w$ to identify the equivalent expressions.**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $60-36w$.","content":"$6(10-6w)$","correct":true},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $60-32w$.","content":"$4(15-8w)$","correct":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $60-36w$.","content":"$12(5-3w)$","correct":true,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $60+36w$.","content":"$3(20+12w)$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"countChoices":true,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":true,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
